OL,3,GNEWSASinger's Hall of Fame induction
OL,4,Aaxed over Russell Brand comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger Ian McNabb will no longer be
OL,7,Finducted into a music Hall of Fame
OL,8,Fafter publicly defending convicted
OL,9,Frapist Russell Brand.
OL,11,FThe former frontman of Liverpool rock
OL,12,Fband The Icicle Works claimed Brand had
OL,13,Fbeen "stitched up".
OL,15,FBrand, 51, was jailed for 10 years and
OL,16,Fsix months on Monday after being
OL,17,Fconvicted of rape and three counts of
OL,18,Fsexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
