OL,3,GNEWSASinger's Hall of Fame induction
OL,4,Aaxed over Russell Brand comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liverpool Beatles Museum had
OL,7,Fplanned to induct McNabb into its
OL,8,FLiverpool Legends Hall of Fame, but has
OL,9,Fnow shelved the plans following his
OL,10,Fcomments.
